      AZ: 'Figures from analysts, since the state publishes no party breakdown: Stealth Analytics for 2026 (11 days out), Data Orbital for 2022 (12 days out), the Arizona Democratic Party tracker for 2024 (14 days out). Eight days before the 2022 election, the Democratic lead was still 3 points.',
      IA: 'Secretary of State statistics: ballots received by mail or cast at the county office.',
      ME: 'Secretary of State absentee voter file.',
